{"version":1,"youtubeId":"UciYihpJMJE","start":2757,"end":2795,"segments":[{"start":2757,"end":2795,"mode":"F","confidence":0,"focus":{"x":0.5,"y":0.45}}],"sentences":[{"text":"sitting once and he said, This is the straight path,","s":2757.04,"e":2759.92,"next":2759.92,"key":"straight","words":[{"w":"sitting","t":2757.04},{"w":"once","t":2757.36},{"w":"and","t":2757.68},{"w":"he","t":2757.92},{"w":"said,","t":2758.08},{"w":"This","t":2758.64},{"w":"is","t":2758.8},{"w":"the","t":2758.96},{"w":"straight","t":2759.12},{"w":"path,","t":2759.52}]},{"text":"and he has a sahaba around him.","s":2759.92,"e":2761.76,"next":2761.76,"key":"sahaba","words":[{"w":"and","t":2759.92},{"w":"he","t":2760.08},{"w":"has","t":2760.24},{"w":"a","t":2760.4},{"w":"sahaba","t":2760.56},{"w":"around","t":2761.04},{"w":"him.","t":2761.2}]},{"text":"And he draws a line with his finger, a straight line.","s":2761.76,"e":2765.76,"next":2765.76,"key":"straight","words":[{"w":"And","t":2761.76},{"w":"he","t":2761.92},{"w":"draws","t":2762.16},{"w":"a","t":2762.48},{"w":"line","t":2762.72},{"w":"with","t":2762.88},{"w":"his","t":2763.12},{"w":"finger,","t":2763.36},{"w":"a","t":2764.32},{"w":"straight","t":2764.56},{"w":"line.","t":2764.88}]},{"text":"He said, 'th, this is my straight path.","s":2765.76,"e":2768.88,"next":2768.88,"key":"straight","words":[{"w":"He","t":2765.76},{"w":"said,","t":2765.92},{"w":"'th,","t":2766.07},{"w":"this","t":2766.22},{"w":"is","t":2766.37},{"w":"my","t":2766.52},{"w":"straight","t":2766.72},{"w":"path.","t":2767.88}]},{"text":"And then he starts drawing these lines on either side of it.","s":2768.88,"e":2772.72,"next":2772.72,"key":"drawing","words":[{"w":"And","t":2768.88},{"w":"then","t":2769.12},{"w":"he","t":2769.28},{"w":"starts","t":2769.44},{"w":"drawing","t":2769.76},{"w":"these","t":2770},{"w":"lines","t":2770.32},{"w":"on","t":2770.8},{"w":"either","t":2771.12},{"w":"side","t":2771.52},{"w":"of","t":2771.68},{"w":"it.","t":2771.84}]},{"text":"And he said, These are the false and astray paths.","s":2772.72,"e":2778,"next":2778,"key":"astray","words":[{"w":"And","t":2772.72},{"w":"he","t":2772.88},{"w":"said,","t":2773.12},{"w":"These","t":2773.68},{"w":"are","t":2774.32},{"w":"the","t":2774.56},{"w":"false","t":2774.88},{"w":"and","t":2775.28},{"w":"astray","t":2775.6},{"w":"paths.","t":2777}]},{"text":"And on every path is a caller at the gates of the fire.","s":2778,"e":2784.88,"next":2784.88,"key":"caller","words":[{"w":"And","t":2778},{"w":"on","t":2778.24},{"w":"every","t":2778.64},{"w":"path","t":2779.2},{"w":"is","t":2779.6},{"w":"a","t":2779.84},{"w":"caller","t":2781.4},{"w":"at","t":2782.4},{"w":"the","t":2782.64},{"w":"gates","t":2782.8},{"w":"of","t":2783.12},{"w":"the","t":2783.28},{"w":"fire.","t":2783.88}]},{"text":"And every single one of them will take the one that answers their call to the fire.","s":2784.88,"e":2795,"next":2795,"key":"answers","words":[{"w":"And","t":2784.88},{"w":"every","t":2785.2},{"w":"single","t":2785.76},{"w":"one","t":2786.24},{"w":"of","t":2786.48},{"w":"them","t":2786.64},{"w":"will","t":2787.2},{"w":"take","t":2787.52},{"w":"the","t":2787.76},{"w":"one","t":2787.92},{"w":"that","t":2788.08},{"w":"answers","t":2788.32},{"w":"their","t":2788.72},{"w":"call","t":2788.96},{"w":"to","t":2789.52},{"w":"the","t":2789.76},{"w":"fire.","t":2794.71}]}]}
